WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.625
Module four: access governance.

2
00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:06.261
Conditional Access decides
whether a session may proceed,

3
00:00:06.261 --> 00:00:09.675
and PIM decides whether a
privileged role may be active.

4
00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:12.199
Neither decides whether
a person should still

5
00:00:12.199 --> 00:00:14.400
hold the access they were given last year.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.275
A grant nobody re-confirms is a
decision made once and trusted forever.

7
00:00:19.275 --> 00:00:23.410
Three mechanisms close that gap
without anyone opening a ticket:

8
00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:28.440
requests through access packages, reviews
on a calendar, and lifecycle events.
